      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Well the Trending Category is there to see worlds with a lot of people in / are popular. This category definitely has it's right to exist so people can easily find worlds with a lot of other players. \nIf someone wants to do some world hopping they can just switch to one of the other categories. And I don't see how that is a big problem.",
