      "value": "@{5a49664b513e7625f7f9509e|full_name}: Trending ensuring that newer worlds receive more weight in their ranking would lead to the same result as the old menu with multiple rows did. That is allowing the casual user to discover newer worlds of high quality with ease.\nIn fact I think this algo change would be even better than relying on multiple rows, since only the top 4 worlds in each row really benefited from this old UI system in the first place. Compared to 20+ worlds of any category showing up together now by default. But as said it needs an algo change for Trending to really make this a success for users and ambitious creators.",
